Security is a foundational platform requirement.

## Security Domains

```text
🔐 Identity
   ↓
🛡️ Authorization
   ↓
🔒 Encryption
   ↓
🚦 Rate Limiting
   ↓
🧹 Input Validation
   ↓
🧾 Audit Logging
   ↓
📊 Monitoring
   ↓
