```

### Security Controls

* HTTPS/TLS
* Secure cookies
* CSRF protection
* XSS protection
* SQL injection protection
* Input validation
* Output encoding
* Rate limiting
* Abuse detection
* Secure headers
* Secrets management
* Dependency scanning
* Authentication controls
* Authorization enforcement
